   "final_text": "The feed had one change, and it's fully handled. The feed has had no new events for about five hours, and nothing I started is still waiting.\n\n**Event 1: job change for Leila Kowalski (E1004), case case-d9bc1d97, effective 2026-11-02**\n- **What changed in Workday:** she moved to the Data Platform team, with a new cost center (CC-5000 Data Platform) and a new manager, Kofi Larsen (E1017). Her job title is still Software Engineer.\n- **Identity:** no changes needed. Her account (acct-7fd63116) already has exactly the standard access for a Software Engineer: All-Staff, Eng-Git and VPN-Users. She keeps the same licence and mailbox.\n- **Expense approver:** changed from her old manager to Kofi Larsen. She has no expense reports in progress, so nothing needed moving to him.\n- **Cost center:** Finance first rejected the update because the new Workday cost center wasn't linked to a Finance cost center code. I asked the Finance team to add the link (request req-09b4e5d2). They mapped it to CC-5000, and I then moved her from CC-1000 to CC-5000 and checked that it took effect.\n- **Corporate card, equipment and legal:** none of these are affected by a team move, so I made no changes there.\n\nI didn't need to escalate anything to a human."
